# Phoenix Down: "from your graveyard". Bot2 mills its own Llanowar Elves (Thought Scour) and Bot1's graveyard holds no creature card, so on
# turn 3 the return mode is not offered at all and there is no Spirit, Skeleton or Zombie either: the Phoenix Down cannot be activated
# (every mode needs a target). With a Spirit in play (the other scenarios) it can.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Mox Pearl
Phoenix Down
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Thought Scour
Island x5
Llanowar Elves
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Phoenix Down.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot2)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Phoenix Down.Activate

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Phoenix Down.Tapped = false
Bot2.Graveyard = Thought Scour; Island; Llanowar Elves
